  "scope": "Original song action-bar composition, membership callback and responsive size hook; original duration/playcount header composition. Component rendering and remote transport are not executed.",
  "substitutions": [
    "React memo/useCallback are identity operations; JSX records inert trees.",
    "Design-system components are inert labels. Authentication, membership and playback hooks receive synthetic values.",
    "The membership setter records requested values, resolves or rejects locally; no account mutation occurs.",
    "Logging is inert local recording; optional playlist logging and the video control experiment are disabled.",
    "The original responsive size hook receives supplied viewport bands.",
    "Duration/number formatting is tagged input recording, with no claim about formatter internals."
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "No new HTTP/protocol compatibility, real account acknowledgement, download behavior, lyrics or recommendation-section behavior is claimed.",
    "The original membership hook is substituted; the rejection case proves callback settlement only, not original hook rollback or server state."
  ],
